            "normalized_html": "<p>Now, using the fact that <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\sqrt{a^2} = |a|,]</span> we can simplify our expression even further. This gives</p>",
            "readable_text": "Now, using the fact that [MATH: \\sqrt{a^2} = |a|,] we can simplify our expression even further. This gives",
